WEBVTT

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.040
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.810
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.150
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.980
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:43.690
With you guys

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.690
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.360
If we join forces

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:52.330
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:55.670
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:02.840
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:08.980
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:11.050
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:13.980
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:17.120
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.290
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:25.290
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:29.000
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:33.040
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:35.900
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.910
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:42.110
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:52.650
Someone once said...

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:02.960
There are palms upon which grow a bounty 
of delicious Hayashi beef rice fruit...

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:06.030
Hayashi Palm Beef Rice Trees!

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:13.840
There are soft-furred, 
sweet cotton candy sheep...

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:16.940
Cotton Baa-Baa Candy created by 
Mr. Green of Kawasaki Prefecture!

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:18.110
Cotton Baa-Baa Candy!

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:25.950
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:31.630
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:38.500
There are two training ingredients left 
on the IGO President, Ichiryu's list.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:44.240
One is somewhere in the Lost Forest, 
the Human World's vastest sea of trees.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:49.010
In order to have the exact location 
of that ingredient divined,

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:53.450
Toriko had Monchy, the fortune-telling 
sushi craftsman, make a Fortune Roll.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:01.990
Now we can go... to the Lost Forest!

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:10.230
Put Your Hands Together and Bow! Gourmet 
National Treasure, Chin Chin-Chin, Appears!

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:21.040
It's too huge!

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.910
It's going right up into the clouds!

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:26.640
The difficulty level of the 
divined direction was so high

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.780
that it's become this size, dumbass.

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:31.220
Thanks!

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:32.750
I appreciate this, Monchy!

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.990
It's too early to thank me.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.790
It's gonna fall!

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.460
I-It's tipping!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:46.900
Better get out of the way.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:51.470
It's gonna fall even as the fillings 
packed in grow thousands of times longer.

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:55.770
Then it'll tell you the 
direction you guys wanna go.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:17.960
Here it comes! Here it comes!

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:24.100
Don't come this way!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.100
Here it comes!

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:53.830
This direction?!

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:56.800
Yeah. If you follow the 
Fortune Roll as you eat it,

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:59.600
you'll run into the ingredient you seek.

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:01.540
So get goin', morons!

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.480
Thank you, Monchy-san!

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:13.380
You're Komatsu, the guy who 
created Century Soup, right?

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:14.720
Yes...

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:18.420
Troubles lie ahead in the 
direction you're gonna take.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.760
Looks like you're in for a long, rough path.

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:23.460
But don't get your undies in a bunch!

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.730
There'll be plenty of hope, too!

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:30.400
One of these days, I'll divine 
your direction for you, dummy!

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.300
That'd be great! Please!

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:35.970
Hey, let's eat, Komatsu!

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:37.800
Right!

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:42.840
We give thanks for all of 
this world's great bounty...

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.110
Thank you for the food!

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.780
Delicious!

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.180
This vinegared rice!

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.790
They don't call it King Vinegar for nothing!

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:54.120
The Eco Seaweed is great too, Komatsu!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.420
It sure is, Toriko-san!

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.360
Eat every last bite and find 
what you're lookin' for!

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:06.000
The direction those two are 
goin' for the near future

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.800
seems to be full of incredible 
ingredients just waitin' for 'em...

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.300
The dopes...

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.880
This is Wiener Eggplant!

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:23.380
Monchy, what a guy! He 
must've secretly added it!

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:24.950
Pretty snazzy!

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:29.960
The skin is meaty like sausage

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:33.060
while the inside is delicious eggplant 
filled with lots of meat juice!

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.890
Now I'm tastin' Imitation Crabmeat Flower!

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:39.000
The Imitation Crabmeat Flower 
petals are out of this world!

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:43.400
Here it is! The ingredient we captured!

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.800
Madam Fish!

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:46.640
I can't get enough of this flavor...

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:50.640
Highest quality fatty tuna mixed 
with the sweetness of salmon roe!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:54.150
It quickly melts right on your tongue!

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:57.520
But it's weird...

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.520
As delicious as this Fortune Roll is,

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:03.090
the animals aren't even getting 
close to it, let alone eating it.

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:07.120
That's because there's the teensiest 
bit of Durian Bomb in here.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.860
It's thanks to that smell?!

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:13.100
I'm so glad we got that 
Durian Bomb, you know?!

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:14.600
It was worth all the suffering!

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:21.040
Fortune Roll traffic jam?!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.110
Sorry! We'll get this right outta your way!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.810
I wonder what filling we'll run into next!

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:33.780
Whatever it is, I can't wait to taste it!

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:38.490
It's delicious, but I can't eat another bite!

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:40.990
Let's take a little break!

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:41.660
Look!

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:53.870
The Human World's vastest sea 
of trees... The Lost Forest!

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:56.040
That is some kind of vast, alright!

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:59.240
The area is 30 million square kilometers.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:01.480
It has a special magnetic field 
that disrupts electric waves.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:04.380
A compass or GPS is useless in there.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:07.420
It's a forest where once you get 
lost, you'll never get out again.

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:12.690
But we've got the Fortune Roll, 
so we'll be alright, right?

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:16.290
That's right. This'll be our compass.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:17.430
Let's go, Komatsu!

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.490
Right!

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:25.130
Um, there's something important 
I haven't asked about...

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:30.070
What is this ingredient that 
President Ichiryu wants you to get?

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:30.870
Oh.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:32.970
Soap Bubbles.

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:34.980
Soap Bubbles?!

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:36.240
To be precise,

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:38.980
fruit made of bubbles.

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:40.480
Bubble Fruit!

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:42.850
Soap bubble fruit?!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:45.320
Well, of course, I've never seen it myself,

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:48.220
but I'm sure this Fortune Roll 
will lead us right to it!

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:49.990
T-T-Toriko-san!

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:52.790
The end of the Fortune Roll is cut off!

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:56.730
What the hell is this?!

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:59.570
The Fortune Roll... Hell, the sea of 
trees looks like it's been cut off!

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:05.210
I-It's like something just 
scooped up the Fortune Roll...

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:07.240
A huge hole like this...

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:10.010
Is it even possible for something to 
scoop up part of the Lost Forest?!

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:16.920
Crap!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.090
Hey, wait!

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:20.220
W-What is it?

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:21.850
The person who swiped our Fortune Roll!

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:27.230
You got some nerve rippin' off our guidepost!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.730
Strange...

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:37.000
I can smell the Fortune Roll 
and the thief in this area...

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.840
Was there really a person 
in this sea of trees?

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:41.570
Yeah, I'm positive.

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:44.040
And I'm gonna flush 'em out!

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:46.510
Wait for me!

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:54.590
Vanishing Japanese Cuisine

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:56.490
This is...

00:09:56.490 --> 00:10:04.900
Vanishing Japanese Cuisine

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.460
Vanishing Japanese Cuisine?!

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:03.560
The legendary Japanese restaurant that 
supposedly no one knows the location of,

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.760
so finding it is really hard?!

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:09.030
Yeah. And its restaurant rank is ten stars...

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:10.670
A ten-star Japanese restaurant!

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:13.670
Come on, Komatsu! Let's go 
in! For now, let's go in!

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:17.510
Sure! But is it okay to forget about 
the thief of our Fortune Roll?!

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:20.080
I can't fight when I'm hungry!

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.710
Let's get somethin' to eat first!

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:23.880
Right, eat first and then give chase, huh?

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:26.080
Although we really filled 
up on the Fortune Roll...

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.920
But can we go in without a reservation?

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:30.190
It'll be fine!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:33.490
After all, the place is hidden, so 
how can you make an appointment?!

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:38.400
Honor the Food

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:43.130
U-Up close, it kind of looks 
forbidding... or how can I put it...?

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:46.900
First-rate, delicious-smelling aromas 
are wafting my way from inside!

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:49.570
Hello there!

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:51.140
Excuse me!

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:52.440
Huh?

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:57.950
The restaurant...

00:10:58.480 --> 00:10:59.720
...vanished?!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:14.530
Just now...

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:16.060
There was a restaurant here, right?!

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:22.570
Toriko-san!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.470
S-Somebody's over there!

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:27.540
Huh?

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:28.740
Where?!

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:31.380
I saw a person right there...

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.810
Put your hands together.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:35.480
And then bow.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:38.390
The restaurant!

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:39.490
What's goin' on here?!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:41.420
Wait... You heard that, right?!

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:42.760
Y-Yes...

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:45.160
"Put your hands together" and then "Bow"...

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:49.160
Maybe it's a kind of charm or something...

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:51.570
You need a charm to get into the restaurant?!

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:54.840
I don't know, but let's try it once!

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:56.540
Put our hands together...

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.940
...and bow.

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:07.550
Wow! We really got in like that!

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.680
Even though just finding 
the place is tough enough,

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:13.320
you gotta jump through hoops to go inside?!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:15.290
Welcome.

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:19.060
Thank you for coming...

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.560
...to Vanishing Japanese Cuisine.

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:25.770
I am Chiru, the master chef here.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.940
Chiru-san, number 15 on the Chef's Ranking!

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:32.470
I never dreamed I'd meet 
you in the Lost Forest!

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:34.640
Come. I'll take you to your table.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:38.540
Um... We don't have a 
reservation. Is that okay?

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.810
Of course. Please, follow me.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.980
Then lead on!

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:47.390
Is there another customer here?

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:52.290
The whole restaurant smells 
of delicious aromas...

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.990
But that's a ten-star 
Japanese restaurant for you.

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:58.360
Still, why is it in the Lost Forest?

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:01.300
It would be easier for customers to come 
if you were in a more convenient area.

00:13:01.770 --> 00:13:06.340
Our restaurant uses extremely 
delicate ingredients.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.570
Because of that, it's a problem

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:11.310
if customers casually 
enter the establishment.

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:13.310
A problem?

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:16.210
Yes. Gourmet Etiquette.

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:19.380
That is, someone who does 
not properly honor food

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:21.990
Honor the Food

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.990
is not able to eat the food here.

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:24.620
In order to protect the delicate ingredients

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.890
from boorish customers who don't 
understand about honoring food,

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:30.330
we operate the restaurant 
here in the Lost Forest.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.630
I see.

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:36.000
And if a customer like that does 
come, the restaurant vanishes, huh?

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:36.800
Correct.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:41.910
It's built from Sycnomore Tree, said 
to be the shiest, most cowardly tree

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:43.970
in the Gourmet World.

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:47.010
Is that the same tree that's 
also used recently for safes

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:50.150
Sycnomore Tree

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:49.280
because of its camouflage ability?

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.180
Indeed.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:56.420
It's a singular tree that can disguise 
itself from nearby ferocious creatures.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:14:00.960
The very materials of the building protect 
the restaurant's delicate ingredients.

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:04.190
So that's why we suddenly 
couldn't see the restaurant...

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:07.830
You two have been readily accepted

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:10.170
by this building as well as the ingredients.

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:12.270
That's unusual these days.

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:15.100
What's even more impressive is 
that you found the restaurant.

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:20.410
Well, that's only because I was 
following the scent of a weirdo...

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:21.340
A "weirdo"?

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:22.980
Chiru-san!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:26.550
That customer intends to eat even more! 
But the food won't be ready in time!

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:38.290
So that's what happened...

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:40.930
One of our staff has been extremely rude.

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:42.560
Chirin, apologize.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.100
B-But, listen...

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:47.700
The Fortune Roll was already scattered 
in pieces when I found it.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.040
All I did was take a little bit.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:54.240
Then you weren't the one who 
scooped out the sea of trees?

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.540
Of course not!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.480
Like I could do that?!

00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:59.350
At any rate, apologize!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:05.120
W-Well, it is thanks to Chirin-san 
that we came across this restaurant...

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:06.490
That's true.

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:09.360
Our guidepost to the Bubble 
Fruit has been cut off,

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:10.960
but I'm sure we'll figure something out.

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:13.130
Bubble Fruit, you say?

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:14.830
Do you know of it?

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:15.930
Yes.

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:21.270
Bubble Fruit is even deeper 
inside this sea of trees.

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:24.870
Chowlin Temple

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:24.500
It's a treasure of the Chowlin Temple.

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:28.940
Chowlin Temple, huh? Also 
known as the Vanishing Temple.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:33.180
It's a legendary temple, but no 
one knows its exact location.

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:37.480
Bubble Fruit is said to be one of the 
most delicate ingredients in the world.

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:41.120
The previous master chef 
here used to cook it, but...

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:43.860
People used to be able to eat it here?!

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:49.360
Y-Yes. But I'm ashamed to say that my 
skill isn't yet up to the challenge of...

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:50.560
Hey!

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:53.400
I ordered seconds, now hurry up with it!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:55.330
Yes, sir, at once!

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:56.800
That voice...

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:57.400
Yeah...

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:02.070
Put your hands together. And then bow.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:06.210
That's the person we saw in the forest...

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:09.250
That customer's been eating a ton!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:11.350
You're being rude to the customer.

00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:15.290
Now then, please have a seat, you two. 
We'll have your meal prepared shortly.

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:17.260
Alright! Just the words I wanted to hear!

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.770
Bet you're really lookin' 
forward to this too, Komatsu!

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:32.000
It's not every day you get 
to eat ten-star cuisine!

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:35.410
That's if you <i>can</i> eat it...

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:36.510
Chirin...

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:38.510
Thank you for your patience.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:39.840
We'll begin with an aperitif.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:43.110
It's Kelp Sake, made with the 
broth taken from Kelp Rock.

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:45.250
What?! Kelp Rock?!

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:47.350
You start with a water temperature 
of 3 degrees Celsius

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:49.290
and raise it by one degree each hour,

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:53.120
while submerging the rock into the 
water one millimeter at a time.

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:57.530
But if you move it a millimeter another 
way, it won't release any more broth!

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:01.730
That's right! It takes five 
days minimum to prepare this!

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:03.530
Incredible! Thank you for the drink!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:04.670
Wait a moment!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.240
What was that?!

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:09.670
Its savoriness escaped.

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:10.470
Say what?!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:14.240
When you drink Kelp Sake, 
there's a certain set movement.

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:17.710
Neglect that and its savoriness vaporizes.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:19.820
Seriously?!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:23.090
Incidentally, the required movement 
takes a lot of patience especially.

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:24.520
I see...

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:27.620
So there are Special Savory 
Ingredients too, huh?

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:28.420
It's nerve-wracking...

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.390
Don't upset the surface of the liquid.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.630
Let your mind be at peace.

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:38.670
Gently bring the cup to your mouth.

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:40.670
Slowly...

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.980
20 minutes later and you 
finally make it this far!

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:53.050
I-I don't think I can do it!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:56.120
Breathe deeply and keep calm, Komatsu!

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:00.190
Sorry!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.560
Next is Sunshine Cheese.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:06.890
Please partake of it only 
while being hit by sunlight.

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:10.230
Because if the sun's not on 
it, it'll get hard as a rock.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:12.230
This looks like a good place for it.

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:14.600
Huh? Uh-oh! Clouds!

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:19.070
Delicious...

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.280
This is a Million Tomato.

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:24.850
You need to politely peel away each 
of its 1,000 membranes one by one.

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:27.510
It gets crushed easily, so pick it up gently!

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:29.820
Gently...

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:32.220
Shoot!

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:34.960
I wasn't trying to put any pressure on it...

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:37.120
This is Star Rice.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:39.960
By washing and drying it one grain at a time,

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:41.800
this rice will shine like a star.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:46.830
But when eating it, you gotta stare at the 
rice and not blink or it'll be ruined!

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:49.600
I-I can't look at it! It's too bright!

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.440
Hang in there! Hang in there, Komatsu!

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:03.450
Bring the next dish!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.380
I blew this one, too!

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:06.690
This time for sure!

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:08.720
This is delicious!

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:10.590
Yummy!

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:11.890
Forget this one!

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:14.630
Another fail!

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:24.000
Thank you for the food...

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.310
I couldn't eat most of it!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:30.980
The preparation for all of those 
ingredients is really tough!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:34.110
But the hardest part of 
all is trying to eat them!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:37.880
Those are the ingredients of this restaurant.

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:41.090
The ingredients are more 
delicate than I imagined.

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:44.120
Just keeping them must really 
wear on your nerves, huh?

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:48.860
Yeah. Now I know why you can't 
operate this restaurant in the city.

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:52.130
Still, the little I could eat 
was delicious, worth the effort!

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:54.130
Thank you.

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:58.200
All of the dishes here are 
so elegant and refined...

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:02.070
I wish I could've tasted all of 'em!

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:03.310
I know...

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:12.250
H-He's eating with such vigor... but...

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.650
He's eating it all!

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:17.420
Thank you for the food.

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:19.790
H-He ate everything!

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:21.460
Well, that's only natural.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:25.300
Long ago in the natural world,

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:27.960
ingredients like these were all that existed.

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:34.440
Anyone who couldn't master gourmet 
etiquette would die of starvation.

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:36.810
Apparently, there was an age like that.

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:42.850
If this was that age, you'd be dead...

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:44.780
...Tomiko and Koike.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:46.650
Tomiko... Koike?

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:48.220
W-Who's that?!

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:50.950
Your cooking skills have improved.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:52.890
Thank you, Master Chin.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.460
M-Master...?

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:58.560
That man is the master of Chowlin Temple

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:01.660
as well as a Gourmet National Treasure...

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:05.600
Honor the Food

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.330
Mr. Chin Chin-Chin.

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:07.970
T-This man is...

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:08.770
...Chin...

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:11.170
...Chin-Chin...?

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:22.680
Under our feet, over our heads

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:30.520
The world is spinning

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:35.700
A dream flower

00:21:36.930 --> 00:21:39.170
Is blooming, blooming

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:46.510
Tell me the rest, come on

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:50.380
Lead me by the hand

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:53.710
And take me with you

00:21:54.250 --> 00:22:01.350
Don't leave me here alone

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:04.960
Red shoes

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:08.600
I can't take off

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:19.740
I'm the only one dancing

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:24.640
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:29.680
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:31.450
Hiding Level
8

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:31.450
Yun's Hiding Level is 8!

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:33.520
The allotted time limit is ten seconds!

00:22:33.520 --> 00:22:35.350
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:38.720
This is the third time 
we've done this segment,

00:22:38.720 --> 00:22:41.130
so this is the kind of difficult level 8.

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:44.230
Well, can you find Yun?

00:22:44.230 --> 00:22:46.570
Yun is... right here!

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:56.470
Well? Could you find Yun?

00:22:56.470 --> 00:23:01.480
And speaking of "find", will Toriko 
be able to find the Bubble Fruit?!

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:04.880
For those looking for a clue to next 
week's episode, this segment is for you!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:09.420
There's no mercy for those with no etiquette or manners!

00:23:09.420 --> 00:23:12.920
The temple that beats the spirit of eating into people is brought to light!

00:23:13.390 --> 00:23:16.690
People Without Gratitude Aren't Welcome! Terrifying Chowlin Temple!

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:18.650
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
